>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d06aa0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d06aa0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Working Principle of Polypropylene Filter Bags<\/h3><p>Polypropylene (PP) is a non-toxic, odorless, milky white, highly crystalline polymer with a density of 0.90-0.91 g\/cm3, making it one of the lightest plastics currently available. It is particularly stable to water, with a water absorption rate of only 0.01%, and does not react with most chemicals. The polypropylene fiber is made into loose tissue by needle punching to increase the space for impurity holding. Its internal honeycomb structure can effectively remove solid and soft particles. Larger particle impurities are trapped on the fiber surface, while fine particles are captured in the filter material layer.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-875177c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"875177c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e23769d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e23769d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"501\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3752\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail2.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail2-600x401.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65c1ef9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"65c1ef9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-04-detail3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3753\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-04-detail3.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-04-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-04-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87828ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"87828ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>In summary, the advantages of polypropylene filter bags are mainly reflected in:<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Chemical Resistance<\/strong>: suitable for filtering a variety of chemical media.<\/li><li><strong>Thermal Stability<\/strong>: has high heat resistance and can usually be used in the temperature range of 80~100\u2103.<\/li><li><strong>High Strength<\/strong>: polypropylene fiber has high mechanical strength and can withstand high operating pressure and flow rate.<\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h3>Specifications<\/h3><table border=\"0\" width=\"1079\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"et3\" width=\"384\" height=\"29\">Brand Name<\/td><td class=\"et3\" width=\"695\">Filmedia<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Material<\/td><td class=\"et3\">Non-woven Polypropylene Needle Felt<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Maximum operating temperature<\/td><td class=\"et3\">80-100\u2103<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Mesh Count (per inch)<\/td><td class=\"et3\">26000-60<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Filtartion Area (square meters)<\/td><td class=\"et3\">0.75<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Filtration Accurancy (\u03bcm)<\/td><td class=\"et3\">0.5-200<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Philite\u00ae Exclusive Features<\/h3><ul><li>Gradual mesh count structure.<\/li><li>Suitable for standard filter housings.<\/li><li>Unique manufacturing process enables 62% more filtration area in per unit.<\/li><li>4 times life expectancy than conventional filter bag.<\/li><li>Better contamination absorption.<\/li><li>Highly increased filtration traffic in per unit.<\/li><li>Easy disposal and replacement, minimum time consumption and cost effective.<\/li><li>Latest technology and production concept in Filmedia system and filtration basket design.<\/li><li>100% three-dimension support for filter medium, eliminate the potential breaking threat. Compare to traditional filter bags, 3D-support design extremely decreases contamination retention.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-491860f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"491860f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d38c4cd elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget