 suspended matter and particulate matter in water.<\/li><li><strong>Paint and Ink Industry<\/strong>: Used for filtering liquids such as paint and ink to prevent solid particles from affecting product quality.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c54914 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0c54914\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d6c0b3 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0d6c0b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Chemical-Industry-detail16.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3766\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Chemical-Industry-detail16.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Chemical-Industry-detail16-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Chemical-Industry-detail16-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-313e126 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"313e126\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pharmaceutical-Industry-detail17.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3767\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pharmaceutical-Industry-d